              "weight": 1,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700000301000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aB1cD2eF3g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Many people enjoy hobbies at home. Here is useful vocabulary:\"}},{\"id\":\"hI4jK5lM6n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>reading</b> — books, magazines, or articles\",\"<b>cooking</b> — preparing food\",\"<b>gardening</b> — growing plants and flowers\",\"<b>painting</b> — creating art with paint\",\"<b>drawing</b> — creating pictures with a pencil\",\"<b>knitting / sewing</b> — making clothes or crafts with wool/thread\",\"<b>playing video games</b> — gaming on a console or computer\",\"<b>watching films / series</b> — enjoying movies and TV shows\"]}},{\"id\":\"oP7qR8sT9u\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"To talk about hobbies use: <b>I enjoy / I like / I love / I'm interested in + verb-ing</b><br><em>I enjoy reading. / I love cooking. / I'm interested in painting.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "phrases",
                  "phrases": [
                    {
                      "text": "I enjoy reading books.",
                      "translation": "Мне нравится читать книги."
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "I love cooking dinner.",
                      "translation": "Я люблю готовить ужин."
