              "order": 1,
              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700000308000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"aB9cD0eF1g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Music is one of the most popular hobbies. Useful vocabulary:\"}},{\"id\":\"hI2jK3lM4n\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Music genres:</b> pop, rock, jazz, classical, hip-hop, electronic, folk, country\"}},{\"id\":\"oP5qR6sT7u\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Musical activities:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"vW8xY9zA0b\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>play an instrument</b> — I play the piano / guitar / drums\",\"<b>sing in a choir</b> — perform with a group\",\"<b>attend a concert</b> — go to see live music\",\"<b>listen to music</b> — enjoy music through headphones or speakers\",\"<b>download / stream music</b> — get music from the internet\"]}},{\"id\":\"cD1eF2gH3i\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Expressing preferences:</b><br><em>I prefer classical to pop. / I'm not really into jazz. / My favourite genre is rock.</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
